the IIdleCDOStrategy and update tranches incentives. The method: - redeems rewards (if any) from the lending provider - converts the rewards NOT present in the `incentiveTokens` array, in underlyings through uniswap v2 - calls _updateAccounting to update the accounting of the system with the new underlyings received - it then convert fees in tranche tokens and stake tranche tokens in the IdleCDOTrancheRewards if any - sends the correct amount of `incentiveTokens` to the each of the IdleCDOTrancheRewards contracts - Finally it deposits the (initial unlent balance + the underlyings get from uniswap - fees) in the   lending provider through the IIdleCDOStrategy `deposit` call The method will be called by an external, whitelisted, keeper bot which will call the method sistematically (eg once a day)"},"initialize(uint256,address,address,address,address,address,uint256,uint256,address[])":{"notice":"can only be called once"},"liquidate(uint256,bool)":{"notice":"method used to redeem underlyings from the lending provider"},"pause()":{"notice":"Pauses deposits and redeems"},"restoreOperations()":{"notice":"allow deposits and redeems for all classes of tranches"},"setStakingRewards(address,address)":{"notice":"Set tranche Rewards contract addresses (for tranches incentivization)"},"stMatic()":{"notice":"stMatic contract"},"transferToken(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Emergency method, tokens gets transferred to the governanceRecoveryFund address"},"unpause()":{"notice":"Unpauses deposits and redeems"},"virtualPrice(address)":{"notice":"calculates the current tranches price considering the interest that is yet to be splitted ie the interest generated since the last update of priceAA and priceBB (done on depositXX/withdrawXX/harvest) useful for showing updated gains on frontends"},"withdrawAA(uint256)":{"notice":"pausable in _deposit"},"withdrawBB(uint256)":{"notice":"pausable"}},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"contracts/IdleCDOPoLidoVariant.sol":"IdleCDOPoLidoVa